No excuse. For all future NES games.

00:36:11.280 --> 00:36:13.560
Not to just have. A battery put inside them.

00:36:13.760 --> 00:36:16.440
Yeah. I agree. When people believe me.

00:36:16.440 --> 00:36:30.500
When people believe me.

00:36:30.740 --> 00:36:34.220
When people believe me.

00:36:44.060 --> 00:36:50.020
A portable adaptation of Bionic Commando was released for the Game Boy in 1992.

