Just wondering. Well, it's interesting because, you know, people who grew up with the Game Gear

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:16.500
would think that you just use all six to power the system

00:37:16.500 --> 00:37:19.120
because theirs required six AA batteries.

00:37:20.080 --> 00:37:22.380
But four is still a lot, too, for what it's worth.

00:37:22.640 --> 00:37:24.780
And there were no rechargeable batteries back then.

00:37:24.940 --> 00:37:28.060
