00:37:44.280 --> 00:37:48.700
into a futuristic era instead now.

00:37:48.700 --> 00:37:52.560
It takes place deep in the future to explain his Bionic arm

00:37:52.560 --> 00:37:54.280
because that's just impossible now.

00:37:55.720 --> 00:37:57.020
I would play it.

00:37:57.400 --> 00:38:03.760
I mean... Cool. I would have hoped that understanding the fact that it's not plugged into an AC adapter anymore

00:38:03.760 --> 00:38:08.880
would mean that they would need to develop a password system at the very least.

00:38:09.500 --> 00:38:11.360
But, no, I would still play.

00:38:11.580 --> 00:38:14.580
Yeah, and then we have another handheld title here.

00:38:14.940 --> 00:38:17.360
Bionic Commando Elite Forces.

00:38:17.580 --> 00:38:20.780
It came out in 1999 for the Game Boy Color.

