00:38:37.280 --> 00:38:41.560
So it's like a first-person kind of, you know, in Game Boy Color style,

00:38:41.680 --> 00:38:44.720
like a first-person sniper minigame in there as well.

00:38:44.920 --> 00:38:52.300
That's weird. The bigger story here, a second remake titled Bionic Commando Rearmed

