And it's, you know, I think they were thinking, like,

00:39:20.280 --> 00:39:22.180
this will be a great way to reboot this franchise

00:39:22.180 --> 00:39:25.180
and everybody will get on board and we can have, like, Bionic Commando,

00:39:26.980 --> 00:39:28.600
you know, become our...

00:39:28.600 --> 00:39:31.000
You know, this is 2008, so forgive me here, Sean,

00:39:31.140 --> 00:39:33.260
but is that around Mass Effect one time?

00:39:34.040 --> 00:39:36.660
I would say so, I think.

00:39:37.060 --> 00:39:39.280
I'm almost wondering if this was, like, you know,

00:39:40.220 --> 00:39:42.700
they're like, well, we could do Bionic Commando Rearmed

00:39:42.700 --> 00:39:47.160
and introduce this thing and Capcom will have its own sci-fi adventure trilogy.

00:39:47.480 --> 00:39:51.480
I mean, I wouldn't say that in any way that they were trying to compete with Mass Effect,

00:39:51.780 --> 00:39:55.200
but it was November 20th, 2007.

00:39:55.540 --> 00:39:57.120
There you go. So this was their answer.

