I'm just sticking by that.

00:39:59.520 --> 00:40:03.500
Okay. You know, however, even though they made this enhanced remake,

00:40:04.140 --> 00:40:05.320
Bionic Commando Rearmed,

00:40:05.520 --> 00:40:09.100
the following year they just released Bionic Commando.

00:40:09.520 --> 00:40:11.820
No Rearmed, same exact title as the NES,

00:40:11.960 --> 00:40:15.500
and this is the Xbox Arcade one that you were talking about, Sam.

00:40:15.720 --> 00:40:19.740
And this one, the following year, is a sequel to the NES game

00:40:20.820 --> 00:40:23.140
as, like, a third-person shooter,

00:40:23.140 --> 00:40:27.540
and it picks up exactly where Bionic Commando left off,

00:40:27.660 --> 00:40:29.280
wherever that was, because I didn't eat it.

