but you'd be shocked to know that because this game has so much story built into it

00:43:09.660 --> 00:43:12.840
that the author actually felt like they needed to skip most of it,

00:43:12.880 --> 00:43:16.280
and they just kind of just do the beginning and end of the story

00:43:16.280 --> 00:43:19.480
and leave out the whole, like, middle part of the adventure.

00:43:19.740 --> 00:43:21.000
That's very strange.

00:43:21.580 --> 00:43:24.920
I love the idea of, like, you know, you're going to write a book about it,

00:43:24.980 --> 00:43:26.680
and you're like, there's just too much story here.

00:43:26.680 --> 00:43:28.120
I can't write all this.

00:43:29.680 --> 00:43:30.520
It's already written.

00:43:31.900 --> 00:43:36.960
All right, well, we've been talking about Bionic Commando for, like, 40 minutes now.

00:43:37.160 --> 00:43:41.700
I think it's time that we finally decide whether this is on our essential games list.

