All right, you know, I don't know who I'm going to pick first to vote,

00:43:48.180 --> 00:43:50.800
so instead I'm going to have Joe pick who goes first.

00:43:51.840 --> 00:43:53.340
I'd like you to go first, Mike.

00:43:53.420 --> 00:43:54.340
You know, you never go first.

