Oh, thank you so much.

00:43:55.680 --> 00:43:59.120
I'm going to go first, and here's what I'm going to say about Bionic Commando.

00:43:59.400 --> 00:44:04.860
Where I stand with this game right now is that it was wildly,

00:44:04.860 --> 00:44:11.240
I don't want to say, like, innovative, but wildly different from everything else that we played up until this point,

00:44:11.800 --> 00:44:16.900
and it does all that without being, like, un...

00:44:16.900 --> 00:44:20.460
Sorry, it does all that without, like, being tough to play.

00:44:20.620 --> 00:44:22.580
Like, it's actually fun to play through this game.

00:44:23.020 --> 00:44:27.000
You know, I mentioned the slow pace, but I don't find that to be unrewarding

00:44:27.000 --> 00:44:29.740
because enemies don't just continue to spawn,

00:44:29.740 --> 00:44:33.460
and you can, you know, enjoy whatever you're doing for the time being

00:44:33.460 --> 00:44:35.840
and move on through the stages at your own pleasure.

00:44:36.180 --> 00:44:38.940
So I had a good time playing this game, and even though I didn't beat it,

00:44:39.200 --> 00:44:42.520
I would have probably, like, seen myself coming back to this.

00:44:42.580 --> 00:44:45.660
And when I look at, like, what essential games are right now on this list,

00:44:45.860 --> 00:44:49.860
